          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "O Nkulunkulu wami, beka indlebe yakho ulalele; vula amehlo akho, ubone ukuchithwa kwethu nomuzi igama lakho elibizwe ngawo, ngokuba asilethi ukunxusa kwethu phambi kwakho ngenxa yokulunga kwethu, kepha ngenxa yomusa wakho omkhulu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
