              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "O Nkosi, yizwa; O Nkosi, thethelela; Jehova, yizwa, wenze; ungalibali ngenxa yakho, Nkulunkulu wami, ngokuba igama lakho libizwe phezu komuzi wakho naphezu kwabantu bakho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
