              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Futhi iyoqinisa isivumelwano nabaningi isonto elilodwa; futhi phakathi nesonto uyokwenza ukuba umhlatshelo nomnikelo wempuphu kuphele, futhi ngenxa yokwanda kwezinengiso uyokwenza kube ihlane kuze kube sekugcineni futhi uyothululwa phezu koyedwa.",
